	<item>
		<title>Typora 2.0 来了？老用户需要重新付费吗？新版本有哪些变化？</title>
		<link>https://www.appinn.com/typora-2-early-preview/</link>
					<comments>https://www.appinn.com/typora-2-early-preview/#comments</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[青小蛙]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 08:51:45 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[业界消息]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Typora]]></category>
